## Task

{% set example_act_count = [total_chapters, 3] | min %}
{% set allocation = namespace(next_chapter=1) %}
Return a single JSON object matching this structure. The example shows a complete chapter allocation; replace the illustrative titles, summaries and events with your story:

```json
{
  "act_count": {{ example_act_count }},
  "acts": [
{% for act_number in range(1, example_act_count + 1) %}
{% set chapters_in_act = total_chapters // example_act_count + (1 if act_number <= total_chapters % example_act_count else 0) %}
    {
      "act_number": {{ act_number }},
      "title": "Act Title",
      "summary": "Brief summary of the act.",
      "key_events": ["Event 1", "Event 2"],
      "chapters_start": {{ allocation.next_chapter }},
      "chapters_end": {{ allocation.next_chapter + chapters_in_act - 1 }}
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
{% set allocation.next_chapter = allocation.next_chapter + chapters_in_act %}
{% endfor %}
  ],
  "inciting_incident": "The event that starts the story.",
  "midpoint": "Major midpoint event or revelation.",
  "climax": "The story's climax.",
  "resolution": "How the story resolves.",
  "character_arcs": [
{% for character_name in character_names %}
    {
      "character_name": {{ character_name | tojson }},
      "starting_state": "Character's state at story start.",
      "ending_state": "Character's state at story end.",
      "key_moments": ["Moment 1", "Moment 2"]
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
{% endfor %}
  ],
  "thematic_progression": "How the theme develops throughout the story.",
  "pacing_notes": "Notes on pacing and structure."
}
```

Constraints:
{% if total_chapters < 5 %}
- act_count must be {{ example_act_count }}.
{% else %}
- act_count must be 3 or 5.
{% endif %}
- Include exactly act_count act objects, numbered consecutively from 1.
- Allocate chapters 1..{{ total_chapters }} with no gaps/overlaps across all acts.
- Every act must contain at least one chapter. Never select more acts than chapters.
- Keep all major turning points within the allocated chapters, even when a single act contains the whole story.
- Each act object MUST include all six fields shown: act_number, title, summary, key_events, chapters_start, chapters_end.
- Include character_arcs for all main characters: {{ character_names | join(", ") }}
- Each character_arc MUST include: character_name, starting_state, ending_state, key_moments.

CRITICAL OUTPUT CONTRACT:
- Return ONLY valid JSON (the entire response must be JSON; no surrounding text).
- Return a single JSON object at the top level.
- Do NOT wrap the object in an array or another object.
